      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had a slightly unusual install, a two-storey townhouse with limited roof space and some tight access restrictions, but Deionno's sales rep came out to the property and was able to sort out what system would fit and where all the pieces would go without any problems. The installers did a very neat job with the install and the cabling despite a rather lengthy cable run from my second-storey roof through to the back of my garage where the batteries and inverter were installed. They were also very communicative and responsive and we were able to sort out a few minor problems that cropped up without any drama. Overall I'm very happy with the new system.",
