      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Although not the cheapest, I thought Deionno Electrical had the best quality system of all other 3 quotes. The Sales rep, Curtis, was very professional, friendly and courteous and explained the whole solar system to my complete satisfaction.  He outperformed the other sales reps.The 4 installers were not outsourced  contractors but all employed by Deionno Electrical. They arrived on time, completed the Installation quicker than expected and did not leave any rubbish behind. They were happy and willing to discuss any questions I had.The system was up and running before they left. I was given a complete rundown of how the system worked and instructed me how to read the solar application on my mobile phone. The app gives a current and previous days readout of what the solar system is producing, what power I’m using from the solar system and from the grid and what goes into the grid from the solar system. Deionno Electrical also monitor my system from their office and know immediately if my system requires attention.If you’re thinking of solar, I thoroughly recommend Deionno Electrical. You won’t be disappointed.",
