      "review_date": "2021-01-20",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Deionno Electrical were one of the three companies that Solarquotes recommended. Each of the three provided competitive quotes but Joe was the only person who physically came to see the premises and talk us through the quote.  We were most impressed with his knowledge and the fact that he wasn’t giving us the “hard sell” approach, recognizing that we needed time to consider our options.After giving his company the “thumbs up” we were given an install date and couldn’t wait. The team of people sent to do the install were very professional and were more than happy to explain the process. They also fixed up a few dodgy roof tiles while they were up there! After the install they thoroughly cleaned up the area before leaving.Joe talked us through the process of turning the system off and on, should that be necessary and he also ensured that the web monitoring app was up and running within a few hours of the install being completed. We are waiting now for our electricity provider to change the meter so that we can start seeing the benefits of our PV system.I cannot recommend this company highly enough.Martin & Marie",
