      "review_date": "2021-01-01",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Got the three quotes through SolarQuotes. DE arranged a no-obligation meeting on site which was imperative in my following decision process. DE was flexible with quoting different combinations of components and gave a comprehensive description of the installation and system plus shared the basic 101 solar energy production and consumption knowledge which I to some extent had already acquired by studying the SolarQuotes information sites.The layout of the panels was slightly changed (on my request) on the day of the installation, but that was no major issue.The installation of the 6.6 kW system was smooth and punctual, completed in six hours by the two installers.The system was fully operational and connected to the grid on their departure. In addition the meter isolation switch and the SolarAnalytics production and consumption monitoring system was installed. DE also organised the communication with the electrical provider and authorities.The system has only been operative for 2 months and I've got no other system to compare with so therefore I cannot give highest marks for \"Value for Money\" and \"Quality of System\", but so far I have no reason to believe that I made the wrong choice.",
